  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">E-commerce Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2022, RVO and the Netherlands embassy in Yerevan, Armenia, started a project in the ICT sector (PST21AM01), consisting of a research and information dissemination phase (phase 1) and a local capacity building phase (phase 2).This project will be the implementation of the second phase, with the aim to strengthen the digitalisation of the private sector in Armenia, by enhancing e-commerce skills (a.o. e-commerce business models/platforms, regulatory considerations, digital payment modalities, security recommendations and website design strategies) amongst SME&#x2019;s from multiple sectors.These investments in skills and training are positively associated with the adoption of digital technologies and contributes to the realization of the digital economy of Armenia.</narrative>
  </description>
