     <target value="0"></target>
     <actual value="3">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the inception of the project, we selected SMEs with a maximum size of 50 employees. To measure
the number of potential jobs supported, we conducted an evaluation among 20 SMEs at the end of
the program. This showed that two respondents (10%) hired new employees during the e-commerce
program and together they are employing three new co-workers. 14 SMEs (70%) are intended to
create job opportunities in the near future.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
